    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join dark reimaginings of Snow White, Red Riding Hood, and Alice as they face off against iconic horror villains like Frankenstein's Monster and Count Dracula.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empower your hero by collecting cards and mysterious artifacts. Gather companions and brew potions. Tame magical familiars as your pets and rise as the new dark lord of the cozy Halloween world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Fairytale Heroes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide four legendary heroes with unique skills and playstyles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Collect Cards &amp; Build Your Deck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, upgrade, and combine powerful cards to empower your hero</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Co-op &amp; Epic Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to defeat epic bosses in thrilling battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Companions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find friendly adventurers and recruit them into your party. Fighting evil as a team is way more fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Magical Familiars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame magical familiars to become your pets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Mysterious Artifacts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find mysterious artifacts and unlock their power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Alchemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0421raft any spell you desire and share the recipe with the community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Procedural Narratives </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions and choices shape a procedurally generated story that\u2019s never the same twice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
